# check.js locates each page's <script> block with a regex that expects a bare
# LF. A CRLF checkout makes that regex miss, and every JavaScript check then
# skips silently while still reporting a pass. Keep these files LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.css  text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
